; imageStore(img, ivec2(gl_GlobalInvocationID.xy), vec4(1)) on a storage image without NonReadable (DXC RWTexture2D).
OpCapability Cap:Shader
OpMemoryModel AddrModel:Logical MemModel:GLSL450
OpEntryPoint Model:GLCompute %main "main" %gid
OpExecutionMode %main ExecMode:LocalSize 8 8 1
OpDecorate %gid Deco:BuiltIn BuiltIn:GlobalInvocationId
OpDecorate %img Deco:DescriptorSet 0
OpDecorate %img Deco:Binding 5
%void = OpTypeVoid
%fn = OpTypeFunction %void
%f32 = OpTypeFloat 32
%v4 = OpTypeVector %f32 4
%u32 = OpTypeInt 32 0
%v3u = OpTypeVector %u32 3
%v2u = OpTypeVector %u32 2
%itype = OpTypeImage %f32 Dim:Dim2D 0 0 0 2 ImgFmt:Rgba16f
%pimg = OpTypePointer Storage:UniformConstant %itype
%img = OpVariable %pimg Storage:UniformConstant
%pin3 = OpTypePointer Storage:Input %v3u
%gid = OpVariable %pin3 Storage:Input
%f1 = OpConstant %f32 f32:1.0
%c1 = OpConstantComposite %v4 %f1 %f1 %f1 %f1
%main = OpFunction %void 0 %fn
%l = OpLabel
%g = OpLoad %v3u %gid
%gx = OpCompositeExtract %u32 %g 0
%gy = OpCompositeExtract %u32 %g 1
%c = OpCompositeConstruct %v2u %gx %gy
%t = OpLoad %itype %img
OpImageWrite %t %c %c1
OpReturn
OpFunctionEnd
